    <Major>Last chaos clicker bot</Major>
    <Description>
A clicker for Last Chaos designed for farming large groups of monsters, utilizing constant key presses of 1 and 2 for rapid attacks, along with the TAB key to efficiently switch targets. This tool optimizes the gaming experience, allowing players to focus on strategies and maximize effectiveness in battles. Ideal for long farming sessions, this clicker aids in quickly obtaining resources and increasing the character's power level. 
To be used on window game with 1600x900 resolution.
Enjoy! and good luck farming!</Description>
